---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const prompt = `Help me set up Wayfinding for my team. Read these instructions and follow
them step by step. Before you install anything, create a repository or
share any data, tell me what you will do and wait for my OK.

curl -fsSL https://wayfinding.support/start.md`;
---
<Base
  title="Wayfinding"
  description="Decide whether, where and how AI serves your mission, your relationships and your work."
>
  <main>
    <h1>Wayfinding</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Decide whether, where and how AI serves your mission, your relationships and your work.
      Refusal, non-AI alternatives and limited use are valid outcomes.
    </p>

    <h2>Start with your agent</h2>
    <p>Copy this into your AI agent. It will read the instructions and ask before it does anything.</p>
    <pre id="prompt">{prompt}</pre>
    <button type="button" id="copy">Copy</button>

    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The Wayfinding framework and a facilitator-led guide, in a repository your team owns.</li>
      <li>A shared knowledge base your agents and people can add to, search and comment on.</li>
      <li>Provenance on everything: whether a person or an agent wrote it.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Status:</strong> early. The tool is being built; the instructions say what works today.</p>

    <footer>
      <a href="/start.md">Agent instructions (start.md)</a>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    const button = document.getElementById('copy');
    const text = document.getElementById('prompt')?.textContent ?? '';
    button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
      button.textContent = 'Copied';
      setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = 'Copy'), 1500);
    });
  </script>
</Base>
